WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.400
Okay, Marty. It's your turn.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.840
So

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.960
we are now leaving executive session

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.440
and we're coming back to our regular meeting.

00:00:13.085 --> 00:00:16.685
I would like to make a motion that we adjourn our regular meeting

00:00:16.685 --> 00:00:20.445
for Monday, April 12 at 10:06PM.

00:00:20.685 --> 00:00:22.205
I'll second that.

00:00:22.525 --> 00:00:24.525
All right. Further discussion?

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:28.640
All those in favor? Aye. Opposed?

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:30.800
Abstaining?

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.400
No. We're good? All right. Thank you very much. We'll see you guys later.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:36.880
Good night.
